AmneziaWG is a WireGuard-compatible VPN protocol that adds traffic
obfuscation (junk packets, padding, custom message headers and
signature packets) to resist detection by Deep Packet Inspection.
With all obfuscation settings left empty it interoperates with
standard WireGuard peers.

This plugin is a port of the OPNsense core WireGuard implementation
(opnsense/core fa31068e35f1) using the amnezia-kmod kernel module.

https://docs.amnezia.org/documentation/amnezia-wg/

